OL,3,ATed Lasso honours Anthony Head with
OL,4,Afresh tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Head's lasting legacy continues
OL,7,Fto be honoured months after his death,
OL,8,Fwith a major TV show issuing a fresh
OL,9,Ftribute to the acclaimed actor.
OL,11,FDuring an emotional penultimate episode
OL,12,Fof the current Ted Lasso's season, the
OL,13,Fshow finished with a dedication to the
OL,14,FBath-based actor who formerly played
OL,15,Fwealthy businessman Rupert Mannion.
OL,17,FThe tribute comes as the series' latest
OL,18,Fepisode reintroduced Rupert's name in
OL,19,Fthe storyline, despite him not
OL,20,Fappearing in the season.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
