OL,3,ATed Lasso honours Anthony Head with
OL,4,Afresh tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead died in June at the age of 72
OL,7,Fafter developing complications from
OL,8,Fpneumonia. His long-term partner, Sarah
OL,9,FFisher, died several months earlier, in
OL,10,FDecember 2025, after she was diagnosed
OL,11,Fwith thyroid cancer.
